Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.94,0:28:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and then various bolts with other other other Tesla vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um the stator and the drive inverter are actually also used in the Cybertruck.
