Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,station where we uh attach large absorber motors to measure the uh mechanical power out of the motors
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.74,0:29:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,While we're doing that, we also have uh vibration sensors that are touching on once the gearbox to um
