Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.90,0:34:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone. I hope you guys are having a great day so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.46,0:34:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,My name is Adon Berwa and I am the process engineer for this line known as the automated battery marriage line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.18,0:34:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone. I'm Darshan. I'm the quality engineer for the battery marriage line that you're seeing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.32,0:34:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So as you can see in front of you and as the name suggests this is a completely automated line. I
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.38,0:35:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,believe the only manual thing on this line is the bulk loading which is done by an operator. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.82,0:35:11.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sub packs or the battery packs are delivered to us on automated mobile robots. They enter the cell over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.42,0:35:13.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the robot is in position the auto loader will actually pick
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.69,0:35:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,up the battery pack from the robot and place it onto
