Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.58,0:35:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,here which lifts the pallet up onto this platform. It then gets positioned
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.30,0:35:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,underneath the frame and the carrier actually lowers it down onto the battery
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.70,0:35:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,packs. Once that is done, once everything is in position this little
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.09,0:35:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,shuttle down here with 14 spindles that you see moving right now
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.98,0:35:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually torques all of the battery packs down at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.27,0:36:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So basically it goes from the the front of the vehicle, torques down
